      <a href=3D"http://www.infsec.ethz.ch/research/software/tamarin.html" =
target=3D"_blank">http://www.infsec.ethz.ch/research/software/tamarin.html<=
/a></tt><tt><br>
    </tt><tt>[3] Except in 0-RTT where the server&#39;s Certificate is
      explicitly</tt><tt><br>
    </tt><tt>=C2=A0=C2=A0=C2=A0 included.</tt><tt><br>
    </tt><tt>[4] <a href=3D"https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/316/" =
target=3D"_blank">https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/316/</a></tt>
